<title>UK: Eurotunnel shares to resume trading Oct 8.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel shares to resume trading Oct 8.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel SA/Plc said on Monday it expects trading to resume in its existing units and warrants on the stock exchanges of Paris, London and Brussels at the opening of business on Tuesday October 8.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel on Monday announced a restructuring of 8.7 billion stg of debt and unpaid interest.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel's shares were suspended on Monday October 1.</p>
</text>
